    "salzburg-festival-at": "eventDates status is listed as 'estimated' but the official Salzburg Festival site (salzburgerfestspiele.at) confirms Summer 2027 runs July 16 - August 29, 2027, matching the record exactly, so this could be upgraded to 'confirmed'.",
    "ibiza-clubs-es": "The place field says Sant Antoni de Portmany, but the source (Ushuaïa Ibiza) and the record's own coordinates (38.8851, 1.4052) actually correspond to Playa d'en Bossa, not Sant Antoni (which is on the opposite side of the island). Source: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ushua%C3%AFa_Ibiza",
    "tour-de-france-grand-depart-gb": "eventDates (2027-07-02 to 2027-07-25) span the entire 2027 Tour de France, not just the Edinburgh Grand Départ, which is only the opening UK stages around July 2-4, 2027. Source: https://www.discoverfrance.com/bike-travel-guide/tour-de-france-2027-edinburgh-grand-depart and https://scottishcycling.org.uk/news/edinburgh-to-host-2027-tour-de-france-grand-depart/",
